---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { talks, sortTalksByDateDesc, formatTalkTimestamp } from '../data/talks';
const work = [
{slug:'service-toolbox',name:'Service Toolbox',text:'Tools for the people behind the service desk.',symbol:'↳',tone:'service'},
{slug:'client-toolbox',name:'Client Toolbox',text:'A clearer picture of the clients we look after.',symbol:'▦',tone:'client'},
{slug:'vantage',name:'Vantage',text:'A place for good ideas to become useful work.',symbol:'△',tone:'vantage'}
];
---
<Base>
<h1>Jonathan Christensen</h1>
<p class="intro">I build tools for IT teams at centrexIT. I started in support; now I make software that helps with the work I used to do by hand.</p>
<div class="links"><a href="/resume/">Résumé</a><a href="mailto:mejohnwc@gmail.com">Email</a><a href="https://github.com/mejohnc-ft">GitHub ↗</a><a href="/about/">A little about me</a></div>
<section aria-labelledby="work-heading"><h2 id="work-heading"><a class="year-heading" href="/years/2026/">What I’m proud of this year <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h2><p class="meta section-note">Open a project to explore an interactive replica with fictional data.</p><div class="selected-work">{work.map(item=><a class="work-preview" href={`/projects/${item.slug}/`}><img class="replica-preview" src={`/demos/previews/${item.slug}.svg`} alt={`${item.name} demo preview`} width="720" height="420" /><strong>{item.name}</strong><span class="work-description">{item.text}</span></a>)}</div><p class="meta"><a href="/years/2025/">2025: handing the system over →</a> · <a href="/years/">Through the years, back to 2011</a></p></section>
<section><h2>Agent tools and operational knowledge</h2><p>I turn field experience into reusable tools and standards: <a href="/projects/cadre/">Cadre</a> for agent controls, <a href="/projects/terminalbrain/">TerminalBrain</a> for MCP access to notes, and <a href="/engineering/">an overview of the engineering behind my work</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Other work</h2><p><a href="/projects/territories/">Territories</a>, a place to explore and learn about visual styles. <a href="/projects/shot-pill/">Shot Pill</a>, a small screenshot utility for remote agents. <a href="/projects/rewst-m365-utilization/">M365 reporting</a>, a Rewst Workflow community contribution.</p><div class="links"><a href="/projects/">All projects →</a><a href="/work/">Work history →</a></div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="media-heading"><h2 id="media-heading">Talks &amp; features</h2><ul class="work-list">{sortTalksByDateDesc(talks).map(talk=><li><a href={talk.url}>{talk.title}</a><p class="meta"><time datetime={talk.occurredAt}>{formatTalkTimestamp(talk.occurredAt)}</time> · {talk.format}</p></li>)}</ul></section>
<blockquote>“These autobots are changing the game...”<cite>Suresh Bhagchandani · on our centrexIT team’s work</cite></blockquote>
</Base>
